 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Dominated by the single 3D volume traversal. Subsequent NPR effect generation is $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of pixels, as it uses fast 2D image processing.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(N \times P)$ where $N$ is the number of pixels and $P$ is the number of geometric properties stored per pixel (e.g., 1 for depth, 3 for normals).
-*   **Performance:** Fast enough for interactive exploration. The speed advantage comes from performing heavy processing in 2D rather than 3D [S1, unofficial].
